56?pr=750\n\nI was unable to recreate on another system (GPUA30F) which runs as expected, but can recreate on the SharkMi300X-3 CI system. Only differences I can see is a difference in rocm version, and likely the BKC.\n\nRocm versions on the tested systems:\nSharkMi300X-3:\n```\nROCk module version 6.12.3 is loaded\n```\nGPUA30F:\n```\nROCk module version 6.8.5 is loaded\n```\n\nRunning with AMD_LOG_LEVEL=3 on the failing system I did see a Returned hipErrorInvalidValue:\n```\n:3:hip_module.cpp           :498 : 948676343708 us:   hipModuleLaunchKernel ( 0x0x5644ad95a250, 2, 4, 512, 256, 1, 1, 17536, stream:0x5644ad25d370, 0x7f35d8009540, char array:<null> )\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :730 : 948676343713 us:  Arg0:   = ptr:0x7f34aa200000 obj:[0x7f34aa200000-0x7f35aa601000]\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :730 : 948676343717 us:  Arg1:   = ptr:0x7f35c4400000 obj:[0x7f35c4400000-0x7f35cfc19000]\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :730 : 948676343720 us:  Arg2:   = ptr:0x7f34aa200000 obj:[0x7f34aa200000-0x7f35aa601000]\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :805 : 948676343722 us:  Arg3:   = val:1073741824\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :805 : 948676343725 us:  Arg4:   = val:179390464\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :3198: 948676343731 us:  ShaderName : forward$async_dispatch_114_conv_2d_nhwc_hwcf_1x512x512x256x3x3x256_f32\n:3:rocvirtual.cpp           :3410: 948676343734 us:  KernargSegmentByteSize = 32 KernargSegmentAlignment = 128\n:3:hip_module.cpp           :519 : 948676343738 us:  hipModuleLaunchKernel: Returned hipSuccess :\n:3:hip_context.cpp          :170 : 948676343742 us:   hipCtxSetCurrent ( context:0x5644ad247dc0 )\n:3:hip_context.cpp          :184 : 948676343745 us:  hipCtxSetCurrent: Returned hipSuccess :\n:3:hip_context.cpp          :170 : 948676343750 us:   hipCtxSetCurrent ( context:0x5644ad247dc0 )\n:3:hip_context.cpp          :184 : 948676343754 us:  hipCtxSetCurrent: Returned hipSuccess :\n:3:hip_module.cpp           :498 : 948676343759 us:   hipModuleLaunchKernel ( 0x0x5644ad95a3f0, 2, 262144, 1, 128, 1, 1, 0, stream:0x5644ad25d370, 0x7f35d8009590, char array:<null> )\n:3:hip_module.cpp           :511 : 948676343762 us:  hipModuleLaunchKernel: Returned hipErrorInvalidValue :\n:3:hip_context.cpp          :241 : 948676343778 us:   hipCtxPopCurrent ( char array:<null> )\n```\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\nArtifacts:\nIR: https://sharkpublic.blob.core.windows.net/sharkpublic/ian/flux/vae_f32.mlir\nirpa: https://sharkpublic.blob.core.windows.net/sharkpublic/ian/flux/vae_f32.irpa\n\nIREE compile command used:\n```\n./build/tools/iree-compile --iree-hal-target-backends=rocm --iree-hip-target=gfx942 --iree-opt-const-eval=false --iree-opt-strip-assertions=true --iree-global-opt-propagate-transposes=true --iree-opt-outer-dim-concat=true --iree-llvmgpu-enable-prefetch=true --iree-hip-waves-per-eu=2 --iree-dispatch-creation-enable-aggressive-fusion=true --iree-codegen-llvmgpu-use-vector-distribution=true --iree-execution-model=async-external --iree-preprocessing-pass-pipeline=\"builtin.module(iree-preprocessing-transpose-convolution-pipeline,iree-preprocessing-pad-to-intrinsics)\" ../shark-ai/sdxl_vae/vae_f32.mlir -o vae_f32.vmfb\n```\nruntime command used for that above hipErrorInvalidValue output (I have tried with --hip_async_allocations=false as well thinking it could be an async issue but did not change output):\n```\nAMD_LOG_LEVEL=3 ./build/tools/iree-run-module --module=vae_f32.vmfb --parameters=model=../shark-ai/sdxl_vae/vae_f32.irpa --device=hip://0 --function=forward --input=1x4x128x128xf32\n```\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\nRuntime\n\n### Version information\n\niree version: 340ffbb0995b98da5a0b4db11aacc72c2fb0f204\n\n### Additional context\n\nshark-ai CI started failing with different issue almost 2 weeks ago. That issue was resolved by https://github.com/iree-org/iree/commit/88848b4f5b7ad66fb3c46f19a3f21c9275e83b38 when this started showing up.","closed_at":"2025-01-08T17:44:03Z","closed_by":{